{"slug":"maurice-hinchey","qid":"Q505585","name":"Maurice Hinchey","desc":"American politician (1938–2017)","article":"Maurice Hinchey","born":"1938-10-27","died":"2017-11-22","birthplace":"Tribeca","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"NY-22","f":2003,"u":2013},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"NY-26","f":1993,"u":2003},{"t":"New York State Assembly","w":"","f":1975,"u":1992}],"summary":"Maurice Dunlea Hinchey (October 27, 1938 – November 22, 2017) was an American politician who served as a U.S. Representative from New York and was a member of the Democratic Party. He retired at the end of his term in January 2013 after 20 years in Congress.\nHe was born in  New York City, and  later moved to the Hudson Valley where he attended high school and college, Hinchey had previously represented part of the area in the New York State Assembly since 1975.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"NY-22","p":"D","v":98661,"s":52.66,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"NY-22","p":"D","v":168558,"s":66.44,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"NY-22","p":"D","v":121683,"s":100.0,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"NY-22","p":"D","v":167489,"s":67.16,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"NY-22","p":"D","v":113280,"s":64.19,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"NY-26","p":"D","v":140395,"s":61.96,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"NY-26","p":"D","v":108204,"s":61.78,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"NY-26","p":"D","v":122850,"s":55.21,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"NY-26","p":"D","v":95492,"s":46.18,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"NY-26","p":"D","v":119557,"s":50.42,"w":true,"n":"Maurice D Hinchey"}]}